@step Create the taxpayer profile interactively so the passphrase is chosen at the terminal.
@static aeat config profile create me
@blocked interactive-tty Profile creation prompts for the passphrase through an interactive terminal.
@step Confirm the selected profile is active before configuring AEAT authentication.
@result aeat --format json config profile list
@expect result.profiles[0].active == true
@expect exit_code == 0
